# LESSONS.md is an append-only index: when two PRs each add a line at the top of the same theme,
# a local merge keeps both lines instead of a conflict (GitHub's server-side merge is assumed to
# ignore this). Safe for entry lines: lessons-index-kill fails a finding or decision line kept in two
# versions. For prose it catches only some leftovers (2026-11-01 finding); re-read merged prose.
docs/project/LESSONS.md merge=union
# The switch inventory's facts file is one entry per line: two PRs that add lines at the same spot
# keep both on a local merge. A line kept in two versions is a duplicate key, which tsc and
# switch-inventory.test.ts fail (2026-11-02 finding). A new switch needs no line here at all.
src/lib/agents/deming/switch-inventory-facts.ts merge=union
